---
---

<div class="space-y-8 max-w-3xl">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Scoring rules</h1>

  <section>
    <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-primary mb-3">
      Tournament structure
    </h2>
    <p class="text-secondary text-body-md">
      Football tournaments are structured with an initial group stage or
      round-robin, followed by knockout rounds. For every match, users can
      predict the result.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-primary mb-3">
      Prediction rules
    </h2>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-secondary text-body-md">
      <li>
        You can change your prediction up until <strong class="text-primary font-semibold"
          >30 minutes before</strong
        > the match kicks off.
      </li>
      <li>
        Predictions cover <strong class="text-primary font-semibold">90 minutes</strong> of
        regulation time plus stoppage time (extra time and penalties are excluded).
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-semibold text-primary mb-3">
      Scoring summary
    </h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border">
      <table class="w-full text-body-sm">
        <thead class="bg-neutral">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Category</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">First round</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider">Knockouts</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
          <tr
            ><td class="px-4 py-3">Correct result (win/draw)</td><td
              class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">5</td
            ><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">10</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td class="px-4 py-3">Correct home team goals</td><td
              class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">2</td
            ><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">4</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td class="px-4 py-3">Correct away team goals</td><td
              class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">2</td
            ><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">4</td></tr
          >
          <tr
            ><td class="px-4 py-3">Correct goal difference</td><td
              class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">1</td
            ><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold">2</td></tr
          >
          <tr class="bg-neutral"
            ><td class="px-4 py-3 font-bold text-primary">MAX. TOTAL</td><td
              class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold text-primary">10</td
            ><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-bold text-primary"
              >20</td
            ></tr
          >
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-secondary text-body-md">
      The leaderboard updates automatically 30 minutes after the last match of the matchday ends
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
